Hi
Can you be more specific? I think STOP NORMAL EXIT is expected at the end of a normal run. In the section 'CJS by sex' I get the output below. Perhaps you didn't set the Mark path?
Murray

fm <- secr::RMarkInput(microtusFMCH)
markFM <- RMark::mark(fm, model.parameters =
    list(Phi = list(formula = ~time+sex), p = list(formula = ~time*sex)),
    groups = 'sex', invisible = TRUE, output = FALSE, adjust = FALSE)
