Well, it works now for some reason.  Sorry about that.

However, I am trying to convert my openCR robust design capture histories into Mark capture histories but when I enter the commands below do not seem to work.
I used the example in the RMarkInput help document...

UARBRD <- RMarkInput (join(UARBCHF))
UARBRD.data <- process.data(UARBRD, model = "Robust",
                            time.interval = attr(UARBRD, "intervals"))

< Error in setup.model(model, nocc, mixtures) :
  Invalid type of model = ROBUST Valid types are
NULL
CJS
JS
more...

It does not seem to work for the Ovenbird data either.  Thanks!

